# cannot be committed by accident.
#
# NOT ignored, and must stay tracked:
#   nebula/device/spice/sky130_nfet_only.lib.spice  — OUR trimmed library (G36).
#   It contains only `.include` pointers into the out-of-tree PDK plus a header
#   and `.option scale=1.0u`; it redistributes no model cards.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
sky130A/
sky130_fd_pr/
sky130*/
